  "description": "The most technical bike in our garage. Fast as lightning, light as a feather. The high-end welded Chromoly steel frame is paired with an 8 speed Shimano Alfine internal geared hub and the best carbon belt drive system on the market. The bike is fitted with front and a rear racks for carrying luggage. Thick stays and leather washers keep mud guards stable and silent. A Creme saddle and gummy Creme grips with alluminium bar ends look elegant and are a pleasure to touch. Other fancy features include the Supernova light, Continental GP Urban tyres, and Brooks Cambium saddle. Finished in a high-end multi layer matte paint with a powder clear coat in Mud Green. The Ristretto Lightnight ST is also available with a step-through version, ideal for shorter people, in a beautiful a Porto colour.",
